# Everything the engine and the R&D data need lives in dot-directories:
#   .claude/  engine (agents, skills, hooks, rules, scripts, schemas, tests, VERSION)
#   .codex/   Codex CLI settings for this repository (not installed elsewhere)
#   .rnd/     R&D data (cases, knowledge, index)
# In a host repository (`rnd.py install`), commit `.claude/` and `.rnd/`. SPEC 33/45
# treat case history and knowledge as the actual output, so prefer ignoring
# individual sensitive cases (e.g. `.rnd/cases/RND-*-private-*/`) over all of them.

# local-only Claude Code notes / settings
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json

# python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.tmp

# generated by .claude/scripts/generate_index.py - regenerated on demand, so they
# are not tracked (`rnd.py install` adds the same three lines to a host repository;
# drop them if you want INDEX.md browsable on GitHub)
.rnd/index.json
.rnd/INDEX.md
.rnd/knowledge/catalog.json

# case working files that must not be committed
.rnd/cases/**/artifacts/**/node_modules/
.rnd/cases/**/artifacts/**/.venv/
.rnd/cases/**/experiments/**/logs/*.raw
.rnd/cases/**/reviews/**/codex_last_message.json.partial

# editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
